+
+No `D_spine(t)` and no `D_terminal(t)` is declared: no generic identity or
+certificate for the two residual statements was obtained.  Inventing such a
+denominator from the finite samples would be precisely the forbidden
+generic-specialization fallacy.
+
+The discriminant of `H_t` is `48q^2(t+1)`, and it is reducible over `Q`
