+## 6. Closed terminal family
+
+Assume only for this definition that the scheduled unit substitutions through
+band `2t` exist, and denote their composition by `sigma_t`.  Put
+
+```text
+E_t(X)=(b3*y-LR)V' + (LS-b3T-b2*g)U' + g*y.            (6.1)
+```
