+```text
+Res_y(H_t,L_C)=-4q^2(3t+2)^3 F_C(t,j),                (5.11a)
+```
+
+so every `C_j` pivot is a unit, including on split fibers.
+
+For `t<=j<=2t`, define
+
+```text
+A_Q=12t^2+16t+4-j(3t+4),
+B_Q=2(t+1)(j-t),
+L_Q=A_Q d+B_Q.                                         (5.12)
+```
+
+The pivot on `q_j` is
+
+```text
+p_Q(t,j)=-3t(3t+1)(q-j)L_Q /
+ ((t+1)q(3t+2)^2(4t-2j+1)).                           (5.13)
+```
+
+Moreover
