+The first lemma plus the unit value `T_(t,0)(0)=-c=-5qg5` closes the `b4=0`
+chart; the second closes `b4!=0`.  At `t=2` all positive-band rows on
+`b4=0` vanish, so `RESIDUAL-ZERO` would be false; instead the band-zero row
