+| `t` | post-H/c rows / auxiliaries | affine pivots | dropped `02` | terminal rows / variables | status |
+|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---|
+| 1 | `11 / 8` | `4 then unit` | n/a | n/a | banked exact `[1]`; boundary collision |
