+bands:     0,...,2t-1,
+weights:   wt(b4)=1, wt(b3)=t+1, wt(q_i,0)=i,
+wt(T_(t,k))=4t+1-k for 1<=k<2t;
+T_(t,0)=-c plus a homogeneous part of weight 4t+1.    (6.3)
