+## 6. Closed terminal family
+
+For `t>=2`, let `sigma_t` denote the proved Laurent/Euler substitutions of
+section 5 through band `2t`.  Put
+
+```text
+E_t(X)=(b3*y-LR)V' + (LS-b3T-b2*g)U' + g*y.            (6.1)
+```
